# Shell scripts run in the Linux/WSL container (DOSBox/dosemu harness). With core.autocrlf=true they
# would otherwise be checked out CRLF and break bash (`set: - invalid option`, `$'\r'`). Force LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The container also runs these directly; keep them LF for reproducibility across host/container.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Trained model weights (the tile LoRA and any future ones) are large binaries.
# Track them in Git LFS so a clone doesn't drag the full history of them. The
# weights aren't committed yet, this rule is ready for when they are.
*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
